WEBVTT

00:15:58.945 --> 00:16:01.588
kojom tučete svoje političare.

00:16:01.588 --> 00:16:03.895
Kada ih birate, kada ih ponovo izabirete,

00:16:03.895 --> 00:16:05.307
kada glasate za njih, kada slušate

00:16:05.307 --> 00:16:07.842
što vam oni nude,

00:16:07.842 --> 00:16:09.554
koristite tu riječ, "dobro,"

00:16:09.554 --> 00:16:11.038
i upitajte se,

00:16:11.038 --> 00:16:13.111
"Bi li to napravila dobra zemlja?"

00:16:13.111 --> 00:16:16.404
Ako je odgovor "ne", 
budite vrlo sumnjičavi.

00:16:16.404 --> 00:16:18.829
Upitajte se, ponaša li se tako

00:16:18.829 --> 00:16:20.265
i moja zemlja?

00:16:20.265 --> 00:16:22.397
Želim li dolaziti iz zemlje

00:16:22.397 --> 00:16:23.964
gdje vlada, u moje ime,

00:16:23.964 --> 00:16:25.826
radi takve stvari?

00:16:25.826 --> 00:16:27.582
Ili mi je, s druge strane,

00:16:27.582 --> 00:16:29.210
draža pomisao da hodam svijetom

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.364
visoko podignute glave misleći